    spdx-core:UnitOfMeasure a owl:Class,
            sh:NodeShape ;
        rdfs:label "UnitOfMeasure"@en ;
        rdfs:comment "A class that represents a measured quantity paired with a unit of measure from the QUDT ontology."@en ;
        rdfs:isDefinedBy spdx-core: ;
        skos:definition "A class that represents a measured quantity paired with a unit of measure from the QUDT ontology."@en ;
        skos:note """UnitOfMeasure class provides a structured way to express measurements: such as size, weight, volume, or other quantities.
It combines a numerical value quantity with a unit reference unitQUDT that points to a URI in the QUDT (Quantity, Unit, Dimension and Type) ontology.
